## Takeaway

Vigil automates what humans forget: checking for security bugs, enforcing types, catching regressions. It transforms AI from a fast but risky tool into a fast *and reliable* tool. Every guardrail you add is one fewer thing humans need to remember during code review |--  and one more thing you ship with confidence.

